<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="UTF-8" />
		<title>SweetSpot – practise insulin and food decisions</title>
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<meta name="description" content="A learning tool to practise insulin and food decisions with a virtual person with type 1 diabetes." />
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="<%- build.stylesheet %>" />
        <!-- installable app, see manifest.webmanifest -->
        <link rel="manifest" href="./manifest.webmanifest" />
        <meta name="theme-color" content="#006d7a" />
        <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="./images/icons/apple-touch-icon.png" />
    </head>
	<body>
		<a class="ss-skip-link" href="#<%= appid %>">Skip to main content</a>
		<header class="ss-header">
			<div class="ss-header-inner">
				<p class="ss-name">SweetSpot</p>
			</div>
		</header>
		<main id="<%= appid %>" tabindex="-1">
            <style lang="css">
                #loading {
                    position: fixed;
                    z-index: 1000;
                    background-color: white;
                    height: 100%;
                    text-align: center;
                    line-height: 50vh;
                    left: 0px; right: 0px;
                }
            </style>
            <div id="loading">Loading…</div>
        </main>
		<footer class="ss-footer">
			<div class="ss-footer-inner">
				<p>SweetSpot is a learning tool for people on structured diabetes education, such as DAFNE, to use alongside their course. It shows a made-up person, so it cannot tell you what dose to take. Always follow the advice of your diabetes team.</p>
				<p>Your data stays on this device. Nothing you enter or upload is sent anywhere.</p>
				<p class="ss-report">To report a problem or a safety concern, <% if (build.feedbackUrl) { %><a href="<%- build.feedbackUrl %>">contact the SweetSpot team</a><% } else { %>tell your diabetes educator<% } %>. Please say which version you used.</p>
				<p><a href="accessibility.html">Accessibility statement</a> · <a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a></p>
				<p>SweetSpot version <%- build.version %>. Built on <a href="https://lt1.org/">LoopInsighT1</a>, open source under the MIT licence.</p>
			</div>
		</footer>
	</body>
</html>
